# Receipt — sub-spec 05-versioncurrent (change optimize-test-suite)
# Session outcome. Suite added: tests/versioncurrent_test.sh (the area's only
# version check: exactly two assertions — VERSION's entire content is a semver
# X.Y.Z plus one trailing newline, and VERSION equals the version in the newest
